# RFCOMM's TTY wants the fixed char major 216, which wcd-dsp-glink already
# holds on this kernel: rfcomm_init() then failed as a whole and RFCOMM sockets
# did not exist (bluetoothd: "Unable to connect hfp_ag: socket(STREAM, RFCOMM):
# Protocol not supported") - no Bluetooth headset in calls.  ofono's HFP uses
# RFCOMM sockets, not the TTY.
# CONFIG_BT_RFCOMM_TTY is not set
